WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,180
Got it

2
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,180
Dad is going to cook

3
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:05,180
You wash the books first

4
00:00:07,370 --> 00:00:14,350
Interesting

5
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:20,010
Are you preparing for a price war with me? Lin Yu

6
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:22,010
You bow your head to me and admit defeat now

7
00:00:22,010 --> 00:00:23,010
I might still be able to quit

8
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:26,010
Do you really think this little trick can bring down my store?

9
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:27,040
why not

10
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,840
Then let time prove it

11
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:32,100
For the sake of old classmates

12
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,100
Let me remind you

13
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,100
Keep it now

14
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,100
best for you

15
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,770
We'll see
